<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan Feed group to tender for 54,000T US corn.</title>
<headline>Taiwan Feed group to tender for 54,000T US corn.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan's Members Feed Industry Group will tender on Thursday for a 54,000-tonne shipment of U.S. No.2 corn, traders said on Wednesday.  </p>
<p>The feed group's main buyers are Taiwan's Formosa Oilseed, Fomau Cereal, Morn Sun Feed Mill and Shin Tai Industry.</p>
<p>Details for the tender are as follows:</p>
<p>		U.S. Gulf     Pacific N.W.</p>
<p> 54,000     April 2-16    April 17-May 1</p>
<p>-- Taipei Newsroom (2-5080815)</p>
